Z||000000||LEE498||05-09-99||08:48 PM||||OK hears another one of my crazy questions.6000 rpm redline for v6 fiero stock! what would it take to get a 3.2 to spin up to hmmmm, say 6300-6500 well first i know i'll have to find a way to raise the rev-limiter, but will the crank,and rods hold up? Just to raise the rev limiter up to 6300 on an modified(head work,cam)2.8 would be a world of difference! A little more rev would'nt hurt the sound either. Those damn rice boys 7000-8400 rpms!!!! But they have no TORQUE!! hehe   
